# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-mindful
name: Mindful
polarity: positive
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: number
# The rule in short, for its hovers; its own words below (the page the user gave, 2026-11-20).
summary: >
  In the Mindful State, Dodge Rolls and the Strike Roll of a Parry +1(T).
text: >
  Mindful: This Transformation lends itself well to a calm, serene state of mind.
  –Effect: While in the Mindful State, increase your Dodge Rolls and your Strike Rolls for the Parry effect of the Defend Maneuver by 1(T).

---

[passive]
if (inState("mindful")) {
    dodge += 1(T);
    parry += 1(T);
}
